Package: climate.risk.tool
Title: Physical Climate Risk Assessment for Financial Portfolios
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Theia Finance Labs",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "antonio@theiafinance.org")
Description: Assesses physical climate risk for financial portfolios.
    Asset locations are overlaid with geospatial hazard data (GeoTIFF,
    NetCDF and CSV), hazard intensities are translated into damages and
    revenue and profit impacts, and these are aggregated to company level
    to derive net present value, probability of default (Merton model)
    and expected loss under climate scenarios. Includes an interactive
    Shiny application.
